        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Stop Worrying About How You Won't Get AIDS. And Worry About How You Can. — CDC Poster</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #000;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 60px 70px 30px 70px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .list-zone {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 40px;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.33;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .list-zone .col {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .list-zone p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .headline {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 76px;\n    line-height: 0.98;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    margin: 38px 0 22px 0;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .can-block {\n    width: 480px;\n    margin: 0 auto 0 300px;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.26;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .can-block p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .contact-zone {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin: 42px 0 0 260px;\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n  .contact-labels {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    width: 250px;\n  }\n  .contact-numbers {\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    width: 165px;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n  .responds-logo {\n    background: #2b2b2b;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 4px 0;\n    width: 155px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n  }\n  .responds-logo div {\n    padding: 3px 0;\n    border-top: 2px solid #fff;\n  }\n  .responds-logo div:first-child {\n    border-top: none;\n  }\n  .agency-zone {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin-top: 70px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .hhs-seal {\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n  }\n  .hhs-text {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n  }\n  .hhs-text .sub {\n    font-weight: normal;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    display: block;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .cdc-logo {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    margin-left: 12px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .cdc-sub {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 5px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .code {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"list-zone\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from everyday contact.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from being a friend.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a mosquito bite.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a kiss.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS by talking.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS by listening.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a public pool.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a pimple.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a toilet seat.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a haircut.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS by donating blood.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from an airplane.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from tears.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from food.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a hug.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a towel.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a telephone.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a crowded room.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from an elevator.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a greasy spoon.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a bump.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS by laughing.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS by watching a movie.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a cat.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a schoolyard.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from going to a party.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from taking a trip.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a dog bite.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from visiting a city.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a cab.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a bus.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS at a play.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS by dancing.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS because someone is<br>different from you.</p>\n      <p>You won&rsquo;t get AIDS from a classroom.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"headline\">\n    Stop Worrying About<br>\n    How You Won&rsquo;t Get AIDS.<br>\n    And Worry About<br>\n    How You Can.\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"can-block\">\n    <p>You <em>can</em> get AIDS from sexual intercourse<br>with an infected partner.</p>\n    <p>You <em>can</em> get AIDS from sharing drug<br>needles with an infected person.</p>\n    <p>You <em>can</em> get AIDS by being born to an<br>infected mother.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"contact-zone\">\n    <div class=\"contact-labels\">\n      NATIONAL AIDS HOTLINE:<br>\n      Servicio en Espanol:<br>\n      TTY-Deaf Access:\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"contact-numbers\">\n      1-800-342-AIDS<br>\n      1-800-344-7432<br>\n      1-800-243-7889\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"responds-logo\">\n      <div>AMERICA</div>\n      <div>RESPONDS</div>\n      <div>TO AIDS</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"agency-zone\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder hhs-seal\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Logo: HHS seal]</figure>\n    <div class=\"hhs-text\">\n      U.S. DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH &amp; HUMAN SERVICES\n      <span class=\"sub\">Public Health Service</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cdc-logo\">\n      CDC\n      <span class=\"cdc-sub\">CENTERS FOR DISEASE CONTROL<br>AND PREVENTION</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"code\">NAIEP 10/91 P110</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
